          <mxGeometry x="1470" y="466" width="110" height="46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1075" value="Full" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1580" y="466" width="110" height="46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1076" value="Full = the audience sees it all.   Summary = only the outline (free and busy, a contact&#39;s name).   None = not shared.   Copy = an encrypted copy the host cannot read." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="840" y="524" width="850" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1077" value="Each cell shows the MOST the design allows for that audience. The default for every cell outside &quot;Me&quot; is None." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="840" y="580" width="850" height="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1078" value="Reading the chart in words, for any person:&lt;br&gt;- &quot;My calendar, to my household: Full.&quot;&lt;br&gt;- &quot;My calendar, to my organization: only free and busy.&quot;&lt;br&gt;- &quot;My mail: never leaves my node, except as a copy only I can open.&quot;&lt;br&gt;- &quot;What I post in the public square: public, because I chose to post it.&quot;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="840" y="640" width="850" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="5 Self-selecting replication" id="mesh-5">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2200" pageHeight="1300" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="c1001" value="Replication that people choose: the owner decides what is copied and where. Hosts volunteer capacity. A host stores ciphertext it cannot read. PROPOSED design." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#333333;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1600" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1002" value="OWNER NODE&lt;br&gt;your data, your keys&lt;br&gt;you decide what leaves" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="260" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1003" value="1  Choose what to copy: a data class, a folder, a room. Nothing is copied by default." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="100" width="560" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1004" value="2  Choose how many copies, and which hosts: only peers that offered capacity and that you allow." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="178" width="560" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1005" value="3  Your node encrypts the data with a key only you hold, and splits it into chunks." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="256" width="560" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1006" value="4  Send the ciphertext to the chosen hosts over signed requests." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="334" width="560" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1007" value="5  Hosts prove they still hold it (a periodic check). A failing host is flagged." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="412" width="560" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1008" value="6  Repair: your node re-copies to another allowed host. Revoke: remove a host, the host deletes, new data uses a new key." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="490" width="560" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1009" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" target="c1003" source="c1002" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1010" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" target="c1004" source="c1003" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1011" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" target="c1005" source="c1004" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1012" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" target="c1006" source="c1005" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1013" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" target="c1007" source="c1006" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1014" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" target="c1008" source="c1007" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1015" value="Host A  ·  family box&lt;br&gt;offers 200 GB, 25% of compute, nights only&lt;br&gt;usable by: my household" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1000" y="100" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1016" value="ciphertext" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#4a7fb5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;" parent="1" target="c1015" source="c1006" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1017" value="Host B  ·  community node&lt;br&gt;offers 2 TB, always on&lt;br&gt;usable by: members of nyc" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1000" y="210" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1018" value="ciphertext" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#4a7fb5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;" parent="1" target="c1017" source="c1006" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1019" value="Host C  ·  a second home box&lt;br&gt;offers 800 GB&lt;br&gt;usable by: me only (backup)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1000" y="320" width="340" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1020" value="ciphertext" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#4a7fb5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;" parent="1" target="c1019" source="c1006" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1021" value="CONSENT LEDGER&lt;br&gt;Every offer and every grant is a signed record: who, what, how much, until when. Either side can end it. The ledger is what the relationship chart (page 4) and the settings screen (page 6) read from." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1000" y="440" width="340" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1022" value="WHAT EACH PARTY CAN SEE&lt;br&gt;Owner: everything.&lt;br&gt;Host: ciphertext, its size, and the owner&#39;s node id.&lt;br&gt;Community: only what was shared into it, and counts for quotas." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="590" width="440" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1023" value="WHAT A COMMUNITY NODE NEEDS&lt;br&gt;- a replication target for community records: for example 3 copies on member nodes in the place&lt;br&gt;- roles for nodes with more storage or compute: backup host, relay, compute helper&lt;br&gt;- a quota per member, and a floor of capacity a member host must offer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="500" y="590" width="500" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1024" value="WHAT A PERSON VOLUNTEERS&lt;br&gt;- storage and compute, with a ceiling and hours&lt;br&gt;- to whom: household, organization, community, or named nodes&lt;br&gt;- the person can lower or withdraw it at any time" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1020" y="590" width="320" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1025" value="Built today: node keys and signed requests, a certificate broker, a Headscale tailnet test, Patroni data-tier failover. Not built: the ledger, offers, copies, repair, quotas, any of pages 4 to 6." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#333333;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="740" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="6 Settings screen (mockup)" id="mesh-6">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1434" dy="884" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2200" pageHeight="1300" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="c1001" value="Mockup: &quot;Node resources and sharing&quot;. One screen where a person sees what they offer, what is held elsewhere, what they hold for others, and the relationships in plain words. PROPOSED design." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#333333;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1600" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1002" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;arcSize=1;strokeWidth=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
